events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/commits/a217df53de1bc15583ab7db3027099f84d06be3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T14:27:18Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T14:27:18Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"message":"Docs audit: fix namespace, remove fabricated APIs, align with reality\n\nComprehensive mechanical verification of 86 documentation files against actual code:\n\n- Replaced 130+ references of obsolete `upMVC\\` namespace with correct `App\\Etc\\` across 15 files\n- Rewrote HELPER_FUNCTIONS_GUIDE.md: documented non-existent global functions (route(), csrf_field(), etc.) and `helpers_functions.php` file that was never written. Now covers only the real API: HelperFacade static methods.\n- Removed fabricated Router APIs: $router->group(), ->middleware() chaining, ->where(), ->get(), ''Controller@method'' strings. Clarified that addRoute() returns nothing (no chaining), only addParamRoute() is chainable.\n- Fixed nine broken file references: helpers.php, helpers_functions.php, RateLimitMiddleware.php, alternate route files (Routesc.php, Routesd.php, Controllerd.php), missing test files.\n- Corrected cache path: storage/cache → src/Etc/storage/cache\n- README: fixed broken install instructions (vendor files don''t exist, entry point is public/index.php, .env goes in src/Etc/)\n- Removed .env from project root, clarified it lives in src/Etc/\n- Marked ROUTER_V2_STATUS.md as historical snapshot\n- Verified agent JSON files accurate; no changes needed\n\nAll changes verified by mechanical scan: file paths resolved on disk, namespaces checked against autoloader, methods tested via method_exists(). Zero remaining `upMVC\\` namespace references detected in docs.","tree":{"sha":"6e357ae43b292b6b1358602c56e2d609637904b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/trees/6e357ae43b292b6b1358602c56e2d609637904b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/commits/a217df53de1bc15583ab7db3027099f84d06be3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23263143?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitsHost","id":23263143,"login":"BitsHost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjYzMTQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/upMVC/upMVC/commit/a217df53de1bc15583ab7db3027099f84d06be3a","node_id":"C_kwDOKuaR2toAKGEyMTdkZjUzZGUxYmMxNTU4M2FiN2RiMzAyNzA5OWY4NGQwNmJlM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/upMVC/upMVC/commit/e66bb33928e749d298f1a8f8e59e200ce2a8b8d4","sha":"e66bb33928e749d298f1a8f8e59e200ce2a8b8d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/commits/e66bb33928e749d298f1a8f8e59e200ce2a8b8d4"}],"sha":"a217df53de1bc15583ab7db3027099f84d06be3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/commits/a217df53de1bc15583ab7db3027099f84d06be3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23263143?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitsHost","id":23263143,"login":"BitsHost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjYzMTQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/commits/e66bb33928e749d298f1a8f8e59e200ce2a8b8d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T12:41:03Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T12:41:03Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"message":"Fix docs: module discovery, server, and router\n\nUpdate docs and changelog to correct module-scaffolding and router examples. FIRST-STEPS-GUIDE.md and HOW-TO-GUIDE.md: require Routes/ (capital R) and Routes.php; namespaces must mirror the path as App\\\\Modules\\\\<Module>...; route class must expose an instance method public function routes($router) (not static addRoutes()); do not add per-module PSR-4 entries to composer.json. Built-in server examples now use -t public. Router middleware is passed as the fourth argument to addRoute(); use addParamRoute() for parameterized paths. CHANGELOG.md updated to document these fixes and their verification.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5aa82f326e32c3d120b7dccb4de09262b4e523eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/trees/5aa82f326e32c3d120b7dccb4de09262b4e523eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/commits/e66bb33928e749d298f1a8f8e59e200ce2a8b8d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23263143?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitsHost","id":23263143,"login":"BitsHost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjYzMTQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/upMVC/upMVC/commit/e66bb33928e749d298f1a8f8e59e200ce2a8b8d4","node_id":"C_kwDOKuaR2toAKGU2NmJiMzM5MjhlNzQ5ZDI5OGYxYThmOGU1OWUyMDBjZTJhOGI4ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/upMVC/upMVC/commit/04b7792e49cf77781b27f7e6f7020b1694c93f38","sha":"04b7792e49cf77781b27f7e6f7020b1694c93f38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/commits/04b7792e49cf77781b27f7e6f7020b1694c93f38"}],"sha":"e66bb33928e749d298f1a8f8e59e200ce2a8b8d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/commits/e66bb33928e749d298f1a8f8e59e200ce2a8b8d4"},{"author":{"avatar_ur