gin":"BitsHost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjYzMTQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/commits/8b2526278b0df5f83ebfbd26b5bb33c191e91765/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T10:27:36Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T10:27:36Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"message":"feat(tests): add test suite foundation (Finding 6)\n\nRemove tests/ from .gitignore so test files are tracked. Fix phpunit.xml\nschema (10.5->11.0), bootstrap, and source directories (stale etc/common/\nmodules -> src/Etc, src/Common, src/Modules).\n\nAdd 52 new unit tests across four classes: ApplicationTest (singleton,\npath, protected routes), EnvironmentTest (get/set/has, env checks),\nSecurityTest (CSRF, sanitizeInput XSS, validateInput rules), and\nRouterTest covering addRoute, addParamRoute, and route() URL generation.\n\nFix RateLimiterTest::testCheckActionUsesDefaults to unset env vars before\nasserting class defaults, preventing cross-test env pollution from\nEnvironment::load(). All 69 tests pass (68 pass, 1 skip).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab5dfd460988ba852aa78eb4ae3161cc7ac99ebd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/trees/ab5dfd460988ba852aa78eb4ae3161cc7ac99ebd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/commits/8b2526278b0df5f83ebfbd26b5bb33c191e91765","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":