"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/commits/7273c0a65c70b64e725f4b80c2284c751a3eb75e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T14:04:35Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T14:04:35Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"message":"Use Environment vars for config and sessions\n\nRead session, mail and DB settings from environment/config manager with sensible defaults. Session handling now sets session_name and session_set_cookie_params (lifetime, path, domain, secure, httponly, samesite) using ConfigManager/Environment values and fallbacks. ConfigManager DB charset and collation are driven by DB_CHARSET env. InitModsImproved allows ROUTE_USE_CACHE env to explicitly control caching (falls back to production detection). MailController now uses Environment::get for SMTP settings instead of reading $_ENV directly.","tree":{"sha":"f9a384c28a55854820976f4d8a2dd2a756d3f7a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/trees/f9a384c28a55854820976f4d8a2dd2a756d3f7a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/commits/7273c0a65c70b64e725f4b80c2284c751a3eb75e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23263143?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://git