mmit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T09:48:39Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T09:48:39Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"message":"Add Application registry and provider system\n\nIntroduce a runtime Application registry to support library-mode integrations and package providers (src/Etc/Application.php). Switch package type to \"library\" and define UPMVC_APP_ROOT in public/index.php to locate the host app. Update Config and Environment to resolve paths via Application and guard global defines (THIS_DIR, BASE_URL, SITEPATH); point .env lookup to the app''s src/Etc directory. Improve module discovery robustness (InitModsImproved): safe glob handling and load custom-routes via Application paths. Make Routes load modules from all registered module paths. Add middleware factory support to Router for parameterized middleware (e.g. \"feature:billing\"). Update Start to register and boot providers and merge protected routes from environment with Application-provided protected routes. These changes enable apps and packages to register modules, migrations, routes and middleware hooks cleanly.","tree":{"sha":"9fd63fed5b62fa6d0b533b136e1c5481ff0e5102","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/trees/9fd63fed5b62fa6d0b533b136e1c5481ff0e5102"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/commits/a4cf293dc8109d50a51840f1c345cfdfc8f03864","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23263143?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitsHost","id":23263143,"login":"B