rs/BitsHost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitsHost","id":23263143,"login":"BitsHost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjYzMTQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/commits/a5135d61a60c1f9e1b9dc82c7f6ee487b162756a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T20:53:52Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T20:53:52Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"message":"Add per-route methods, 405 handling & CORS\n\nAllow routes to declare allowed HTTP methods and enforce them: add optional $methods to addRoute/addParamRoute, normalize methods, check methodAllowed during routing, and return a 405 response with Allow header and JSON body when mismatched. Change middleware fallback to throw on unknown middleware names. In Start.php centralize CORS config via getCorsConfig(), use it for global CORS middleware, and add a route-level ''cors'' middleware so routes can opt into CORS handling. These changes enable stricter HTTP method control and more consistent CORS configuration/behavior.","tree":{"sha":"6ab771d4ca11229b147b629df37eeda61992c02e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/trees/6ab771d4ca11229b147b629df37eeda61992c02e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/git/commits/a5135d61a60c1f9e1b9dc82c7f6ee487b162756a","verification":{"payload":n