/BitsHost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitsHost","id":23263143,"login":"BitsHost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjYzMTQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitsHost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/upMVC/upMVC/commits/28222bc7d51b83f91a8c24e7d30b8457b72cce9a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-15T21:02:00Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-15T21:02:00Z","email":"dadryan26@yahoo.com","name":"BitsHost"},"message":"Fix database connection: Add parent::__construct() call in Model\n\nCRITICAL FIX: Models were not connecting to database!\n\nProblem:\n- Product Model had __construct() but didn''t call parent::__construct()\n- BaseModel''s constructor initializes \\->conn with Database connection\n- Without parent call, \\->conn was null\n- checkConnection() always returned false\n- Module always ran in demo mode even with valid DB config\n\nSolution:\n- Added parent::__construct() in Product Model constructor\n- Updated all 3 generator templates (enhanced, CRUD, dashboard)\n- Now properly initializes database connection\n- Models can actually connect to database\n\nImpact:\n- Product module now works with real database\n- CRUD operations persist to database\n- No more forced demo mode\n- Future generated modules will work correctly\n\nFiles changed:\n- src/Modules/Product/Model.php\n- src/Tools/ModuleGeneratorEnhanced/ModuleGeneratorEnhanced.php (3 templates)","tree":{"sha":"780ea