,"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ricardo-devis-agullo","id":16902309,"login":"ricardo-devis-agullo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTAyMzA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-devis-agullo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opencomponents/vite-templates/commits/05ee32167c0780740e586b9d226bc6d68e745597/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T07:56:21Z","email":"Ricardo.Agullo@theaccessgroup.com","name":"Ricardo Devis Agullo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T08:11:43Z","email":"Ricardo.Agullo@theaccessgroup.com","name":"Ricardo Devis Agullo"},"message":"feat(esm): resolve the shadow root and expose it on the mount context\n\nA component can end up inside a shadow root either because it opts into one\nvia oc.files.template.shadowDOM, or because the embedding page mounts it inside\na shadow root it owns. In the latter case a component previously had to walk\nparentNode itself to discover the root.\n\nResolve the shadow root in the template (via the standard element.getRootNode(),\nwhich handles closed and nested roots) and pass it on the mount context as\nshadowRoot, alongside the existing styleElement/styleId. Also export a\ngetShadowRoot() helper for use outside mount.\n\nThe template only reports where the component is rendered; it does not touch the\ncomponent styling or DOM, leaving those decisions to the component.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","