pi.github.com/users/relidaning/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/commits/f7517c6fbf9e34dc44b19cddeecf2852a2f3adc8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:47:11Z","email":"41282656+relidaning@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lidaning"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:47:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"scheduler: fire weekly/monthly/seasonal/yearly tasks on the effective day (#9)\n\nThe triggers read the wall clock, while the stored task date and the\nsame-date check use the effective day (it starts at 06:00). A run between\n00:00 and 06:00 on a trigger day inserted the tasks dated the day before,\nand the first run after 06:00 inserted them again.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2ad8cc4707a050ac8912e6698bf6b47c5811fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/trees/e2ad8cc4707a050ac8912e6698bf6b47c5811fec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/commits/f7517c6fbf9e34dc44b19cddeecf2852a2f3adc8","verification":{"payload":"tree e2ad8cc4707a050ac8912e6698bf6b47c5811fec\nparent bb2a01ac2776912b62403f736d3b5ee87693e309\nauthor lidaning <41282656+relidaning@users.noreply.github.com> 1791427631 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791427631 +0800\n\nscheduler: fire weekly/monthly/seasonal/yearly tasks on the effective day (#9)\n\nThe triggers read the wall clock, while the stored task date and the\nsame-date check use the effective day (it starts at 06:00). A run between\n00:00 and 06:00 on a trigger day inserted the tasks dated the day before,\nand the first run after 06:00 inserted them again.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxwQvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKOUQAGVo2WPkCVnR02PCCdXltCKw\nLua/ixs2p