users/relidaning/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/commits/bdb0452bac77e2c43ef39a55fd2cab6ba3810d65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:41:25Z","email":"41282656+relidaning@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lidaning"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:41:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"besmart: shut down on SIGTERM instead of waiting to be killed (#6)\n\nNode is PID 1 in the container, where SIGTERM has no default action, so\nevery docker stop/restart waited the 10 s grace period and ended in\nSIGKILL (exit 137), leaving the SQLite WAL unflushed.\n\nHandle SIGTERM/SIGINT: stop accepting connections, let in-flight\nrequests finish (3 s cap), close the database (which checkpoints the\nWAL into besmart.db) and exit 0.\n\ndocker stop: 10.2 s -> 0.2 s.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd5bd0dfa08e1222d2dff726ad49abe515a1944c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/trees/bd5bd0dfa08e1222d2dff726ad49abe515a1944c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/commits/bdb0452bac77e2c43ef39a55fd2cab6ba3810d65","verification":{"payload":"tree bd5bd0dfa08e1222d2dff726ad49abe515a1944c\nparent 022be8d3d12f87b071764459d0bd2b4e5a3012f7\nauthor lidaning <41282656+relidaning@users.noreply.github.com> 1790966485 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790966485 +0800\n\nbesmart: shut down on SIGTERM instead of waiting to be killed (#6)\n\nNode is PID 1 in the container, where SIGTERM has no default action, so\nevery docker stop/restart waited the 10 s grace period and ended in\nSIGKILL (exit 137), leaving the SQLite WAL unflushed.\n\nHandle SIGTERM/SIGINT: stop accepting connections, let in-flight\nrequests finish (3 s cap), close the database (which checkpoints the\nWAL into besmart.db) and exit 0.\n\ndocker stop: 10.2 s -> 0.2 s.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv/rVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6kYQACVWADvq9B7ty6h+8L03/as+\nGTrqkRa13Z3OajUHgkifCrswr5NuFvd56JYaENiOkWSxwgfiw9Mf0yK+MjWjYoMq\nPtkShSTXsje0KHx2EJotjRrSzBvV0a4rHQfPLUyWAFEySirEIh0AHdJSdCUGbV7l\n0lzivN2dJ0szUd8Rso3Nee+naKwNFL+iiFO1IS3GcO2S6mThO9gDD3pDkSxu3IPy\nptujYocrZ3+NOjL2wGD1RWG8p0A8GDf7iss5aqlcp2qqNGEaA6XOWaAVFwJAds/s\nJUYCGACSQcVJBgFH6TkfP7s5eItaA3xDB96jxJJbO9b3lqhh0ugdhd6F7Q8qc2mk\n7z0+Cwdz+zJB4FbrTb23jo2MLxuFDJrRF7HmGNatifQDbPANXHjAKBfs/IIwoEcI\nPz0TodxU+kMJeqxtWAa8u/tyLVIyV6QRD7lILvMGW7YwZuNnCwLZLRYM8va+27gO\nuVoxQ4XMQiiYkHTmm0pJrQKKvscVXzRjoGbocrOJYa2vwXBN1q9Y6Q1tDR8fpRV4\nLXPoCsLDOW0HcPpoCYONMTuIJABAwrdQHDTi6YKh4gJN8DBT9kZE+pg7pwyaEA9d\nZp3SDzZXJWh90F/ZGvHUfXoOuiezTKd8fiFu7YqslDhi+MBokyXKzCeOhjz6gjbC\n/eHV52To8KsgyqvgXgfD\n=WttT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T18:41:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/relidaning/besmart/commit/bdb0452bac77e2c43ef39a55fd2cab6ba3810d65","node_id":"C_kwDOKv_9EdoAKGJkYjA0NTJiYWM3N2UyYzQzZWYzOWE1NWZkMmNhYjZiYTM4MTBkNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/relidaning/besmart/commit/022be8d3d12f87b071764459d0bd2b4e5a3012f7","sha":"022be8d3d12f87b071764459d0bd2b4e5a3012f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/commits/022be8d3d12f87b071764459d0bd2b4e5a3012f7"}],"sha":"bdb0452bac77e2c43ef39a55fd2cab6ba3810d65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/commits/bdb0452bac77e2c43ef39a55fd2cab6ba3810d65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41282656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/relidaning","id":41282656,"login":"relidaning","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMjgyNjU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/commits/022be8d3d12f87b071764459d0bd2b4e5a3012f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:38:36Z","email":"41282656+relidaning@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lidaning"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:38:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"besmart: keep the server up on vault watcher errors; retry transient push failures (#5)\n\nAn unreadable directory in the vault (EACCES) made chokidar emit an\n''error'' event with no listener, which crashed the server, and crash-looped\nit on restart. Watcher listeners are now guarded and errors are logged.\n\nThe daily push was lost on any transient network error (e.g. EAI_AGAIN on\n2026-09-26). Transient errors and 429/5xx are now retried with backoff\n(5s/30s/120s), and failures log the HTTP status and body.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2033297a96a23313fd67ea9c26593115dade8f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/trees/f2033297a96a23313fd67ea9c26593115dade8f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/commits/022be8d3d12f87b071764459d0bd2b4e5a3012f7","verification":{"payload":"tree f2033297a96a23313fd67ea9c26593115dade8f5\nparent 0319c8955de29998f22793d6661d879db1c2aaf0\nauthor lidaning <41282656+relidaning@users.noreply.github.com> 1790966316 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790966316 +0800\n\nbesmart: keep the server up on vault watcher errors; retry transient push failures (#5)\n\nAn unreadable directory in the vault (EACCES) made chokidar emit an\n''error'' event with no listener, which crashed the server, and crash-looped\nit on restart. Watcher listeners are now guarded and errors are logged.\n\nThe daily push was lost on any transient network error (e.g. EAI_AGAIN on\n2026-09-26). Transient errors and 429/5xx are now retried with backoff\n(5s/30s/120s), and failures log the HTTP status and body.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv/osCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAf3IQAAVXer0W2slz6udrgT8LjhWt\nD/eTGouMESTamq5mUafVZTEdRwRled6fft45LSMu7b8miGIA+5AAu6HQV3XrsBUi\nxziSbcHmAFuOUPUgKIL9VSBPMFsD+uSImScKemKsn7+0u5JcVkdY8hC5ery8zbjm\nPfvJ6NELmoz