e production JWT_SECRET (the placeholder) and\nthe VAPID private key to a public repo, so anyone could forge a login. They now\ncome from .env (gitignored; .env.example lists them) and compose refuses to\nstart without them. The server no longer falls back to a built-in JWT secret in\nproduction. Both secrets were rotated, which logs every session out once.\n\nA push subscription is bound to the VAPID key, so on startup the client now\nreplaces a subscription made with an old key and re-registers a current one,\ninstead of trusting whatever the phone holds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d4666817bcd1fd88cbe7b34397ca87ed5b3af74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/trees/5d4666817bcd1fd88cbe7b34397ca87ed5b3af74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/commits/3cbe1ec1e2c2b1636e2be31af6d25459cbfbb741","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41282656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/relidaning","id":41282656,"login":"relidaning","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMjgyNjU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github