ub.com/users/relidaning/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/commits/1ec8c5fe0a7c2ffa4a386c6f3b6f940b2613c738/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:55:25Z","email":"453882101@qq.com","name":"relidaning"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:55:25Z","email":"453882101@qq.com","name":"relidaning"},"message":"besmart: vault Tasks.md items for BeSmart\n\n- Check In: a Diary button appends a timed line to the vault''s monthly\n  diary note (0_lidaning/Diaries/YYYY/YYYY-MM.md) under today''s heading\n- Todos: tap anywhere on a card to complete it; the priority pill moves to\n  the meta line so it no longer squeezes the title\n- Garden: plants grow mainly from reviews (6/12/18/22); water is +2, once a\n  plant a day, at most +20 in all (migration 15 re-applies this to past\n  events). Shrubs are drawn as a low dome of clumps, not two big balls.\n  Views keep one fixed layout in planting order and crop to the period''s\n  plants, so Today shows only today''s plants, close up\n- An achievement earned pops the same modal as tapping it on Home\n- Top bar: streak/points no longer wrap, page title shortened to Garden\n- After 10+ minutes in the background the app reloads on resume, and API\n  calls time out after 15 s instead of hanging\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"309579f5a4a6393546c0cafd31ebdd96396ddcf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/trees/309579f5a4a6393546c0cafd31ebdd96396ddcf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/commits/1ec8c5fe0a7c2ffa4a386c6f3b6f940b2613c738","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41282656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/events{/privacy}","f