 Enforced isCompleted=false filter in Todos tab\n\n2. Fixed create new todo form buttons not fully displayed when scrolling:\n   - Made form buttons sticky with sticky bottom-0 bg-white\n   - Added mt-6 for proper spacing\n\n3. Fixed Dashboard tab on mobile showing same info as Todos tab:\n   - Changed MobileBottomNav Dashboard link from ''/'' to ''/dashboard''\n   - ''/'' redirects to ''/todos'', ''/dashboard'' shows actual dashboard\n\n4. Fixed TypeScript error in TodoItem component:\n   - Changed todo.color to todo.category.color\n\n5. Added documentation:\n   - test_fixes.md - test verification details\n   - FIXES_SUMMARY.md - complete summary of all fixes\n   - .gitignore - ignore node_modules and build artifacts\n\nAll fixes tested and working. App runs on http://localhost:3000 with backend on http://localhost:5071.","tree":{"sha":"4aaed0c2faf00a9443be660483cba4f2936b0124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/trees/4aaed0c2faf00a9443be660483cba4f2936b0124"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/relidaning/besmart/git/commits/7c3d91e9036c9828e29f445407dd1e7914a07987","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41282656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/relidaning","id":41282656,"login":"relidaning","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMjgyNjU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relidaning/star