ng_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/melvinchia3636","id":64565584,"login":"melvinchia3636","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTY1NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/commits/b6621952020fa722eddf1afb1e1d48cb59095666/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:51:17Z","email":"melvinchia623600@gmail.com","name":"melvinchia3636"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:51:17Z","email":"melvinchia623600@gmail.com","name":"melvinchia3636"},"message":"feat: serialize dates in the framework instead of per route\n\nTimestamp columns keep `z.date()` in output DTOs and routes return `Date` objects as-is; the framework renders them as `date-time` strings in the generated contract and JSON-serializes them to ISO on the wire.\n\n- `writeContractFile`: run `toJSONSchema` with an override that maps `z.date()` nodes to `{ type: ''string'', format: ''date-time'' }` (zod cannot represent dates in JSON Schema), plus a test.\n- Drop the `z.string()` timestamp overrides and `.toISOString()` conversions in the migrated core libs (apiKeys, auth oauth providers, fonts).\n- Regenerate `packages/api/src/contract.ts`.\n- Document the convention across the drizzle / server DSL / module guides, and correct the stale table-namespacing guidance (createModuleTable() + bare names, db.query.entries).","tree":{"sha":"4a93f398c6d0958cf45746c9d5f4c3bf279f66d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/git/trees/4a93f398c6d0958cf45746c9d5f4c3bf279f66d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/git/commits/b6621952020fa722eddf1afb1e1d48cb59095666","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64565584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/melvinchia3636","id":64565584,"login":"melvinchia3636","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTY1NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/commit/b6621952020fa722eddf1afb1e1d48cb59095666","node_id":"C_kwDOKwlPi9oAKGI2NjIxOTUyMDIwZmE3MjJlZGRmMWFmYjFlMWQ0OGNiNTkwOTU2NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/commit/980b56d708e808494fd7bb8e0848f2e95f802b4b","sha":"980b56d708e808494fd7bb8e0848f2e95f802b4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/commits/980b56d708e808494fd7bb8e0848f2e95f802b4b"}],"sha":"b6621952020fa722eddf1afb1e1d48cb59095666","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/commits/b6621952020fa722eddf1afb1e1d48cb59095666"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64565584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/melvinchia3636","id":64565584,"login":"melvinchia3636","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTY1NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/commits/980b56d708e808494fd7bb8e0848f2e95f802b4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:02:20Z","email":"melvinchia623600@gmail.com","name":"melvinchia3636"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T01:02:20Z","email":"melvinchia623600@gmail.com","name":"melvinchia3636"},"message":"refactor: rework drizzle SDK to be registry-free with per-module query scoping\n\n- Replace `DrizzleSchemaRegistry` with `ModuleRegistry`: `defineModuleSchema`\n  now returns a plain `ModuleSchemaDefinition` and the caller registers it.\n- Auto-namespace module tables: `createModuleTable()` derives the namespace\n  from the caller module id (`detectCallerModuleId`/`deriveModuleNamespace`),\n  so `schema.drizzle.ts` files can declare bare table names.\n- Add `scopeDbForModule`/`proxyDbQuery` so route callbacks can query bare keys\n  (`db.query.events`) while the global db stays namespaced; controller and\n  `getEvents` resolve the key map via `ModuleRegistry.getModuleKeyMap`.\n- Scope the relations builder with a shallow proxy: only `r` and `r.one`/`r.many`\n  remap table keys, so columns named like a table are not hijacked.\n- `composeRelations(parts)` now takes the registered schema parts; `core/drizzle.ts`\n  registers the `core` part and composes them into the global db.\n- Add `defineModuleSchema`/`scopeDbForModule` unit tests (incl. real PGlite) and\n  `test`/`test:watch` scripts to `@lifeforge/drizzle` (pulls in `@electric-sql/pglite`).\n- Rework `instructions/drizzle-sdk.md` around usage; fix `file-storage-sdk.md`.","tree":{"sha":"d6e9f5acbf8f58c67f516dc59429fd82f1787732","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/git/trees/d6e9f5acbf8f58c67f516dc59429fd82f1787732"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/git/commits/980b56d708e808494fd7bb8e0848f2e95f802b4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64565584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/melvinchia3636","id":64565584,"login":"melvinchia3636","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTY1NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https: