:17Z","email":"melvinchia623600@gmail.com","name":"melvinchia3636"},"message":"feat: add existsIn existence checks and db error mapping\n\n- Add forge.existsIn (schema-bound marker) plus collectExistenceChecks /\n  checkRecordExistence pre-flight, wired into controllerLogic\n- Add mapDatabaseError (23503 -> 404, 23505 -> 409) and surface the nested\n  error cause on server errors\n- Make @lifeforge/drizzle LifeForge-only; consumers import drizzle-orm directly\n- Include the file-storage schema in drizzle.config so the central files table\n  is created on push\n- Rework server-dsl-migration and module-structure docs for existsIn","tree":{"sha":"9c4c26eb96311c68bf210d57d8633b42c98807d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/git/trees/9c4c26eb96311c68bf210d57d8633b42c98807d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/git/commits/ba9b524f58ced5b1ca8a8ef2c14416e83b70d09c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64565584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/melvinchia3636","id":64565584,"login":"melvinchia3636","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTY1NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/user