chia623600@gmail.com","name":"melvinchia3636"},"message":"refactor: centralize output status into a response module\n\nMove all output/status definitions into packages/server-utils/src/response, with the Output status table as the single source of truth (status, kind, helper key, hasPayload).\n\n- Response helpers are the declared success helpers plus universal error helpers (badRequest/unauthorized/forbidden/notFound/conflict) available on every route\n- OutputDefinition now only accepts success statuses; error keys were swept from the core API route output declarations\n- Contract serialization and client inference are success-only; NO_CONTENT infers void","tree":{"sha":"3d0e7c9786e7ea9e893c2b401052f2cad9c41b00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/git/trees/3d0e7c9786e7ea9e893c2b401052f2cad9c41b00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/git/commits/cf97c796579826a426b31a3a35ac72d62c528af6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64565584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/melvinchia3636","id":64565584,"login":"melvinchia3636","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTY1NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/subscriptions","type":"User","url