nd was never\npropagated from the server. The sidebar renders items built in\n`bootstrapModules` from the server manifest, so `hidden` was always\nundefined for federated modules (core modules worked since their full\nconfig is passed directly).\n\nParse `hidden` from the client manifest and carry it through\n`moduleEntrySchema`/`moduleManifestSchema`, `ModuleRegistry`, and\n`bootstrapModules` so the sidebar filter can hide these modules.\n\nAlso centralize manifest parsing into a single-pass `parseManifest`\nthat extracts provider, hidden, subsection, and widgets together,\nreplacing the individual parsers and their tests.","tree":{"sha":"31d53f32ace98f5324a8ca7f2da4d40d677d0b2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/git/trees/31d53f32ace98f5324a8ca7f2da4d40d677d0b2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lifeforge-app/lifeforge/git/commits/8839bd44cacdf8b240d84d8ff4b1b28a0a150cdc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64565584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/melvinchia3636","id":64565584,"login":"melvinchia3636","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTY1NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvinchia3636/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/me