hh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thordurhhh","id":24840451,"login":"thordurhhh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODQwNDUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/ad0544cc32022a7a40584e3ef5da315ec1c69fbd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:07:02Z","email":"tolleinn@gmail.com","name":"Þórður H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:07:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ojoi): compare Meginmál against a published advert (#1572)\n\n* feat(ojoi): compare Meginmál against a published advert\n\nAdds a \"Samanburður\" button under the Meginmál editor on the case detail\nscreen. It opens a full-screen modal where the editor searches published\nadverts by number (\"1053/2026\") or title, picks one, and sees a\nread-only structured diff: the published advert as the old text, the\ncase''s saved Meginmál as the new. A toggle shows the published text on\nits own. Nothing is written.\n\nThe diff uses getStructuredDiff from @dmr.is/regulations-tools 0.11.0,\nbumped repo-wide from 0.10.3 (the release is additive; getDiff and the\neditor are unchanged). official-journal-web now declares the dependency\nit was using undeclared through hoisting from regulations-api.\n\nSearch goes through a new searchPublishedAdverts tRPC procedure over the\nexisting getAdverts endpoint. It returns a slim list without advert HTML\nand drops revoked (Afturkölluð) adverts, which is what unpublishing a\ncase sets. Diff marks are styled by the package''s diff.css rather than\ndiffStyling, so formatting-only changes (ins.mod) do not render as added\ntext. Breytingarsaga keeps its existing look.\n\n* style(ojoi): format advert compare with prettier\n\n* fix(ojoi): scope advert compare diff styles and keep a full result page\n\nReview follow-up on #1572.\n\ndiff.css is a global stylesheet. Once Samanburður had loaded it, it also\nrestyled the getDiff marks in Breytingarsaga, EditChangeModal and\nRegulationImpactsFields, which share its class names: ins.mod picked up\nthe dotted format underline, because diffStyling''s textDecorationColor\n''none'' is invalid and drops out. The same rules now live in\nAdvertCompare.css.ts, scoped to the modal''s body.\n\nsearchPublishedAdverts dropped revoked adverts after taking 10 hits, so\na page of mostly-revoked matches showed a short or empty list. It now\nfetches 20 and trims to 10 after filtering.","tree":{"sha":"de958a7892c6852613509dadbd7bc7b69f1d0288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/trees/de958a7892c6852613509dadbd7bc7b69f1d0288"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/commits/ad0544cc32022a7a40584e3ef5da315ec1c69fbd","verification":{"payload":"tree de958a7892c6852613509dadbd7bc7b69f1d0288\nparent aebb5600fcd941528b07148b80e63e660440229a\nauthor Þórður H <tolleinn@gmail.com> 1791382022 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791382022 +0000\n\nfeat(ojoi): compare Meginmál against a published advert (#1572)\n\n* feat(ojoi): compare Meginmál against a published advert\n\nAdds a \"Samanburður\" button under the Meginmál editor on the case detail\nscreen. It opens a full-screen modal where the editor searches published\nadverts by number (\"1053/2026\") or title, picks one, and sees a\nread-only structured diff: the published advert as the old text, the\ncase''s saved Meginmál as the new. A toggle shows the published text on\nits own. Nothing is written.\n\nThe diff uses getStructuredDiff from @dmr.is/regulations-tools 0.11.0,\nbumped repo-wide from 0.10.3 (the release is additive; getDiff and the\neditor are unchanged). official-journal-web now declares the dependency\nit was using undeclared through hoisting from regulations-api.\n\nSearch goes through a new searchPublishedAdverts tRPC procedure over the\nexisting getAdverts endpoint. It returns a slim list without advert HTML\nand drops revoked (Afturkölluð) adverts, which is what unpublishing a\ncase sets. Diff marks are styled by the package''s diff.css rather than\ndiffStyling, so formatting-only changes (ins.mod) do not render as added\ntext. Breytingarsaga keeps its existing look.\n\n* style(ojoi): format advert compare with prettier\n\n* fix(ojoi): scope advert compare diff styles and keep a full result page\n\nReview follow-up on #1572.\n\ndiff.css is a global stylesheet. Once Samanburður had loaded it, it also\nrestyled the getDiff marks in Breytingarsaga, EditChangeModal and\nRegulationImpactsFields, which share its class names: ins.mod picked up\nthe dotted format underline, because diffStyling''s textDecorationColor\n''none'' is invalid and drops out. The same rules now live in\nAdvertCompare.css.ts, scoped to the modal''s body.\n\nsearchPublishedAdverts dropped revoked adverts after taking 10 hits, so\na page of mostly-revoked matches showed a short or empty list. It now\nfetches 20 and trims to 10 after filtering.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxlIGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA19oQAB4+7zpcWtu9oDMinbqFiM9b\nlL/scM6vbSd80Y9oeCnNW1c0rFQxOIUdCXiG64Bg94qB8xEg2fcrb1Lhqb6iMO99\naYER6mjva2U9GptN8EyWZmO2xkND+CmwJuYgkqYH0y1p8wxIvYXTdR+3+GAmI6P7\nODiOsNdlEMHAj8CiYR/n4NZWuaSuBsIP5u/kutzY5xSAtrLu732w1naDK4pe05Lo\nXcb/ZWJMRiseKb8NuhhH0hlhSA/+zxS+jUIVK+GMGsf9XbBJdvCdcQiwBKydmj++\nFlGDWxDs+xF9NO5byI87Kf/4uuuHctHBr5BwhVI/dODVZTKegP+zTQNvyzu2zfXf\n+kC+R0WVnpqqrxatMTpvNrvGye2tr6I3EP/dlB2Et37FGgkpWlJMOp6osx2hMME4\nslYhv5T3w4D7M48wd0YafTf7Jo1hVqgVGfohcRYk0Sc0fsps6PeYeKesq8EOpsFR\nf7ptgj1/hHNTb