"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/1858167fc1dd7ca2c15417af4682eb0931fbac00","node_id":"C_kwDOKxEuldoAKDE4NTgxNjdmYzFkZDdjYTJjMTU0MTdhZjQ2ODJlYjA5MzFmYmFjMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/fb7af6b7c40ccefa44bdbb2c9c0f6e7b2ba21d26","sha":"fb7af6b7c40ccefa44bdbb2c9c0f6e7b2ba21d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/fb7af6b7c40ccefa44bdbb2c9c0f6e7b2ba21d26"}],"sha":"1858167fc1dd7ca2c15417af4682eb0931fbac00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/1858167fc1dd7ca2c15417af4682eb0931fbac00"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24840451?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thordurhhh","id":24840451,"login":"thordurhhh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODQwNDUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/fb7af6b7c40ccefa44bdbb2c9c0f6e7b2ba21d26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:40:27Z","email":"tolleinn@gmail.com","name":"Þórður H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:40:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(doe): reword Launagögn pay headers and mark required tooltips (#1566)\n\nThe Directorate reworded four Launagögn headers. J and M gain \"/ álag\",\nK becomes \"Fastur ökutækjastyrkur / bifreiðahlunnindi\" and N becomes\n\"Tilfallandi / mældur ökutækjastyrkur / bifreiðahlunnindi\". The columns\nmean what they did, so the template version stays 2.0.\n\nThe layout check matches row-5 headers by prefix. J and M still match,\nbut K and N did not, so the new template would have been rejected as\nout of date. K and N now accept the new wording and, through a new\n`formerly` list, the earlier 2.0 wording, so copies downloaded before\nthis change still upload.\n\nThe tooltips on H (Ráðningardagsetning) and I (Grunnlaun) said \"Skildu\neftir autt ef á ekki við\", but the parser rejects a row missing either\nfield. Both now say \"Skyldureitur.\"\n\nOnly xl/sharedStrings.xml and xl/worksheets/sheet4.xml changed in the\narchive. template-data.ts is regenerated from the new template.","tree":{"sha":"74ed318376fed11bc4d36b4cc1f3c6e42dfa4f69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/trees/74ed318376fed11bc4d36b4cc1f3c6e42dfa4f69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/commits/fb7af6b7c40ccefa44bdbb2c9c0f6e7b2ba21d26","verification":{"payload":"tree 74ed318376fed11bc4d36b4cc1f3c6e42dfa4f69\nparent fd6423736b1f1c3e754810b8fce527dae2596c62\nauthor Þórður H <tolleinn@gmail.com> 1790952027 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790952027 +0000\n\nfix(doe): reword Launagögn pay headers and mark required tooltips (#1566)\n\nThe Directorate reworded four Launagögn headers. J and M gain \"/ álag\",\nK becomes \"Fastur ökutækjastyrkur / bifreiðahlunnindi\" and N becomes\n\"Tilfallandi / mældur ökutækjastyrkur / bifreiðahlunnindi\". The columns\nmean what they did, so the template version stays 2.0.\n\nThe layout check matches row-5 headers by prefix. J and M still match,\nbut K and N did not, so the new template would have been rejected as\nout of date. K and N now accept the new wording and, through a new\n`formerly` list, the earlier 2.0 wording, so copies downloaded before\nthis change still upload.\n\nThe tooltips on H (Ráðningardagsetning) and I (Grunnlaun) said \"Skildu\neftir autt ef á ekki við\", but the parser rejects a row missing either\nfield. Both now say \"Skyldureitur.\"\n\nOnly xl/sharedStrings.xml and xl/worksheets/sheet4.xml changed in the\narchive. template-data.ts is regenerated from the new template.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv8JbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfFsQAJoEjqmHfwIkc/JfamO0ZZZc\ncPgablqPL3e87iz3eeItokfHyJLcNSV8h2Jng1UsHZKhRmiA41LJuc2cPHoDkieF\nfUDNgHmYx3zEQy8cPVK6V9bwzQv41Vu02R9mNmj3nTIyufoqFwMODvKhTdzarfs8\njXKpdsJXF+JYP3w/OBkYC5qr2aU+OtPQDxBqxPMKC0WmbUq8Xc/IoTVHXUhRTIUJ\nfaoDI7z/qSTiAoLqbDD925/t2WoERjyiot0roQ/Rsh1IgpqZkKPtrLOVtrYsp0nn\nxax0xOdjqghUcmQ75aZAYYSVQqf3hDiwSK/uXYIwW/S2eGf4kllVy01bjO5+OnlB\n9fTmfQJjqea9rncTWZX781a5Skkpb5ZTBhG19vAJG4WxhPbDVqj0IZqjzoGODG40\nnAgDmp0cBFfA9ZA9qUDkeG+57SvZ8F22nwcVgzA9wcOfzvSm2EbyllvJig/EyttV\nlRndVVrgSFnmNtlEdVFfX4PiR1xIRTBVCNsqhPT31mpLEQ62IwCfuwo3AK3cm64e\njqvUDsPPVQuY4yReFPX0MCACtw5pqJAR3Z+WFJlGW9O3LYFfUXasHEYBGlrlYOQD\nrq7ttYypM7ZQwVylw6oB6hlemidyUh6NGqcenlUPkbBO+sdApXqJ/4+A6V9IBhh6\nBPln4yg1sQteYoKKt5NG\n=Mq4f\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T14:40:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/fb7af6b7c40ccefa44bdbb2c9c0f6e7b2ba21d26","node_id":"C_kwDOKxEuldoAKGZiN2FmNmI3YzQwY2NlZmE0NGJkYmIyYzljMGY2ZTdiMmJhMjFkMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/fd6423736b1f1c3e754810b8fce527dae2596c62","sha":"fd6423736b1f1c3e754810b8fce527dae2596c62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/fd6423736b1f1c3e754810b8fce527dae2596c62"}],"sha":"fb7af6b7c40ccefa44bdbb2c9c0f6e7b2ba21d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/fb7af6b7c40ccefa44bdbb2c9c0f6e7b2ba21d26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24840451?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thordurhhh","id":24840451,"login":"thordurhhh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODQwNDUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/fd6423736b1f1c3e754810b8fce527dae2596c62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:42:28Z","email":"tolleinn@gmail.com","name":"Þórður H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:42:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(doe): clarify salary workbook tooltips on Launagögn (#1565)\n\nThe Directorate asked for guidance on where álagsgreiðslur belong. Columns\nJ, M and O now carry their own input prompts, titled \"Krónur á tímabilinu.\",\nexplaining which surcharges are fixed pay and which are incidental. The\nshared I6:O505 validation is split per column so each can carry its own\ntext; every range keeps the same decimal >= 0 rule and error message.\n\nColumn E''s prompt and error message still described paid hours as including\nall overtime, contradicting the 2.0 header. Both now say fixed overtime\nhours count and incidental ones do not.\n\nOnly xl/worksheets/sheet4.xml changed in the archive. The parser reads no\nprompts, so it needs no change, and the template version stays 2.0.","tree":{"sha":"997f0ddd03b01e3e54bb9ba6f860fca26cb94373","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/trees/997f0ddd03b01e3e54bb9ba6f860fca26cb94373"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/commits/fd6423736b1f1c3e754810b8fce527dae2596c62","verification":{"payload":"tree 997f0ddd03b01e3e54bb9ba6f860fca26cb94373\nparent 4912967c0eadc2ee4416df7ab938e63e901d8e05\nauthor Þórður H <tolleinn@gmail.com> 1790851348 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790851348 +0000\n\nfix(doe): clarify salary workbook tooltips on Launagögn (#1565)\n\nThe Directorate asked for guidance on where álagsgreiðslur belong. Columns\nJ, M and O now carry their own input prompts, titled \"Krónur á tímabilinu.\",\nexplaining which surcharges are fixed pay and which are incidental. The\nshared I6:O505 validation is split per column so each can carry its own\ntext; every range keeps the same decimal >= 0 rule and error message.\n\nColumn E''s prompt and error message still described paid hours as including\nall overtime, contradicting the 2.0 header. Both now say fixed overtime\nhours count and incidental ones do not.\n\nOnly xl/worksheets/sheet4.xml changed in the archive. The parser reads no\nprompts, so it needs no change, and the template version stays 2.0.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvjkUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAi84QAGLXKgCUONGmFySlJuwLwFcK\n6C4WiNdnuaXAEXZMf9Lkgswe0cg4DeMZX6E4uowegdq9hC1HVXlLKAIwWHptmgEy\ne+7nRbDzQSpTnO6du8lCEYC/ccUtsbafJTGOxhRBl0pJt2N0vUHmVW1GKgv/EZJT\nvUdo1wUoOUjZj6Z8LUXUBNonY9PfxJQQbqUnuZ0rjhDsXth5ZPY9R62ZwK/pReEi\nIdc26+n3jfNRHh56+2SC/Zna0BBfSsOuwSX8qsasarQs3TIoCy9QYeOJoo7tlkHE\nitG5taYe+tnEpVqP/UwlQ4buPCR5oceY8lRRUmnfn1vkY5h8YW2G88DdVM8UeWKa\nUVxxF+R7UXovL25xJmtiyEPFyD1sVy40p9LgwDgbzfs9pwrpnOdTm9Iyb7E59Gl4\nlk8Jm8EFRAcicI0N+GPjBmylPmjcTkDcdlLcxf9CD/cjzGoEGnxb7LdccM4/MUFu\n25pR5Jeg7B+b98+CmDUVEKhZz0DOXaYoSidmU4J1Ik8XzkcVP8D4GtjIoMNSEiZV\n0wKdmwcYDz43g2vLZgXgFfN5MA4y/1CVjbPbFWPUJK0aNsXuAYiEdeC14FXk/nmn\njt88RYMO4dXoUlzPo+Zh5I8gIMuyPcfy0XnmVdLad+MFBClZ7qhMtgTfZUrEhXOC\n6JTg4CKC8P56J0eAqfuk\n=Raj4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T10:42:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/fd6423736b1f1c3e754810b8fce527dae2596c62","node_id":"C_kwDOKxEuldoAKGZkNjQyMzczNmIxZjFjM2U3NTQ4MTBiOGZjZTUyN2RhZTI1OTZjNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/4912967c0eadc2ee4416df7ab938e63e901d8e05","sha":"4912967c0eadc2ee4416df7ab938e63e901d8e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/4912967c0eadc2ee4416df7ab938e63e901d8e05"}],"sha":"fd6423736b1f1c3e754810b8fce527dae2596c62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/fd6423736b1f1c3e754810b8fce527dae2596c62"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24840451?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thordurhhh","id":24840451,"login":"thordurhhh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODQwNDUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/4912967c0eadc2ee4416df7ab938e63e901d8e05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:32:33Z","email":"tolleinn@gmail.com","name":"Þórður H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:32:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(doe): ship the 2026-09-24 salary workbook (#1560)\n\n* feat(doe): ship the 2026-09-24 salary workbook\n\nThe template''s authors added an Einstaklingsbundið dropdown on Viðmið C10,\nformula-driven sorting on Yfirlit, and a Yfirviðmið definitions section on\nthe metadata tab, which they renamed from \"Undirviðmiðalisti (Lýsigögn)\" to\n\"Viðmiðalisti (Lýsigögn)\". Viðmið D6:D10 hold typed text rather than\nformulas, so a workbook written by a tool that does not recalculate keeps\nits descriptions. Template version stays 2.0.\n\nThe parser needed no change: it reads no tab by the renamed name, and the\nparsed sheets'' columns are untouched. The sub-criterion catalog generator\ndid, since CI runs it: it now finds the tab under either name and stops at\nthe new Yfirviðmið section instead of reading it as catalog rows. The old\ntab name stays on the ignored-sheet list for workbooks filled before the\nrename.\n\n* feat(doe): reword the four job-based criterion descriptions\n\nJafnréttisstofa rewrote the Lýsing of Ábyrgð, Álag, Vinnuaðstæður and\nHæfni. Each is one shared string in the workbook, feeding both Viðmið\nD6:D9 and Viðmiðalisti (Lýsigögn) D57:D60, so only xl/sharedStrings.xml\nchanged; no formula reads those cells.\n\nThe seed capture carries the same wording and is updated to match, with\nrich-demo-sheet.json regenerated from it by refresh-wage-gap-fixtures.\n\n* fix(doe): address review of the 2026-09-24 workbook\n\n- refresh-sub-criterion-catalog.js: Viðmið D6:D10 repeat the Yfirviðmið\n  definitions as typed text; the comment still said they look them up.\n- workbook.schema.ts: say that IGNORED_SHEETS is descriptive. Nothing reads\n  it, so the comment no longer implies the set has an effect.\n- workbook.parser.spec.ts: pin Viðmið D6:D10 equal to the metadata tab''s\n  D57:D61. No formula links the two copies, so a template that rewords only\n  one would store descriptions that disagree with its own reference list.\n- generate-test-workbooks.ts: write C10 = Einstaklingsbundið, the only value\n  the new dropdown accepts, and keep the D10 the template ships. The\n  generated files now match what a current workbook looks like.\n\nNo change to template.xlsx.","tree":{"sha":"2150b01a500cb368eda86b190a6535391746c4bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/trees/2150b01a500cb368eda86b190a6535391746c4bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/commits/4912967c0eadc2ee4416df7ab938e63e901d8e05","verification":{"payload":"tree 2150b01a500cb368eda86b190a6535391746c4bf\nparent 81dbe373a9820fb3eee858c59bfd2918d6ec1c53\nauthor Þórður H <tolleinn@gmail.com> 1790760753 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790760753 +0000\n\nfeat(doe): ship the 2026-09-24 salary workbook (#1560)\n\n* feat(doe): ship the 2026-09-24 salary workbook\n\nThe template''s authors added an Einstaklingsbundið dropdown on Viðmið C10,\nformula-driven sorting on Yfirlit, and a Yfirviðmið definitions section on\nthe metadata tab, which they renamed from \"Undirviðmiðalisti (Lýsigögn)\" to\n\"Viðmiðalisti (Lýsigögn)\". Viðmið D6:D10 hold typed text rather than\nformulas, so a workbook written by a tool that does not recalculate keeps\nits descriptions. Template version stays 2.0.\n\nThe parser needed no change: it reads no tab by the renamed name, and the\nparsed sheets'' columns are untouched. The sub-criterion catalog generator\ndid, since CI runs it: it now finds the tab under either name and stops at\nthe new Yfirviðmið section instead of reading it as catalog rows. The old\ntab name stays on the ignored-sheet list for workbooks filled before the\nrename.\n\n* feat(doe): reword the four job-based criterion descriptions\n\nJafnréttisstofa rewrote the Lýsing of Ábyrgð, Álag, Vinnuaðstæður and\nHæfni. Each is one shared string in the workbook, feeding both Viðmið\nD6:D9 and Viðmiðalisti (Lýsigögn) D57:D60, so only xl/sharedStrings.xml\nchanged; no formula reads those cells.\n\nThe seed capture carries the same wording and is updated to match, with\nrich-demo-sheet.json regenerated from it by refresh-wage-gap-fixtures.\n\n* fix(doe): address review of the 2026-09-24 workbook\n\n- refresh-sub-criterion-catalog.js: Viðmið D6:D10 repeat the Yfirviðmið\n  definitions as typed text; the comment still said they look them up.\n- workbook.schema.ts: say that IGNORED_SHEETS is descriptive. Nothing reads\n  it, so the comment no longer implies the set has an effect.\n- workbook.parser.spec.ts: pin Viðmið D6:D10 equal to the metadata tab''s\n  D57:D61. No formula links the two copies, so a template that rewords only\n  one would store descriptions that disagree with its own reference list.\n- generate-test-workbooks.ts: write C10 = Einstaklingsbundið, the only value\n  the new dropdown accepts, and keep the D10 the template ships. The\n  generated files now match what a current workbook looks like.\n\nNo change to template.xlsx.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvNcxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAv5YQAC8dVO+CXrKtNGdl5TDdT4YT\nFKkzFbP33d01+Y1J08+Nkq6guU/K0Ur3NqyBxezExTYJWebQ0ilrJYRf5JyrVsoe\n/qXprbfT7XquS9l2SZYVerOu3uyZwFqsSx/4cBS8MzF6pG7s7/swO8UAtziMCkO4\nly8pN2a1kKTQXuRmByNpivN8PNQfyCNjo/iGSlX4JHpG9NGGvi+Z9bvXTHlYvT9V\njJ+YhHAFwQNxe7GZfnUCpZdhXOu1GuujXzy3baJOJhZt5pfdUk8ngpQbZ+SpEUhf\nnp+/eqWowFfHoDtgQjzvt/+kVqq8WacPLHGXVsBINr4k0ACP5UyhEtaX27pIl8DT\na2MFr8UsRrH66d6h9qjjj/XognI/z3wKK9L7qfcLN6G9yivtabbd3QKeaaBLxkBI\neS9PCy32bLWaVMkgdTW+Om1RbmvhbO5Zb3sHv+iuLF02/9kEMv/iiPULh5PnGLE0\nnuWAAjFj4sFDg4ojVrIcjhIU1YFODImF0hwy/DYdAisqT+8+TmjNekVroFO5ksDj\nlEOnbuQTdk6tJACUiTMjdLQutkle2SbqWXJ2ukLoLczY1VV6VxcVCohDexpKV/rv\ngGZypTYkVo9L0MzMCFzSn9+EB4jKal2PJV5CFTn8MvREIZg9YGlNRutjR8L3RyFP\nCE8sEr6E0Ff6jkdC+d/a\n=uOGw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T09:32:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/follo