rhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thordurhhh","id":24840451,"login":"thordurhhh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODQwNDUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/d1430f9de2003d231a97532e711f3446afed9fae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:35:27Z","email":"tolleinn@gmail.com","name":"Þórður H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:35:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(doe): report timeline edit rows, denial icon, and read-only remedy date picker (#1561)\n\n* fix(doe): name the company on edit rows and cross out denials in the timeline\n\nEdit events never carry an actor: only the applicant edits a report, and\nthey have no doe_user. The row rendered as a headless \"gerði breytingar á\nskýrslu\". Fall back to the company name, as the submitted row already does.\n\nA report moved to DENIED showed the generic event checkmark, which reads as\nthe opposite of a rejection. It now gets a cross.\n\n* fix(doe): disable the remedy deadline picker on the salary tab\n\nisland-ui''s DatePicker controls `open` itself and opens on any input\nclick, so readOnly still popped a calendar for a date nobody can change\nhere. disabled keeps it shut and renders the disabled style, matching\nthe equality plan dates (#1524).","tree":{"sha":"03bf54ca0d9edcb39ca5bdb3f9fe17667dd35452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/trees/03bf54ca0d9edcb39ca5bdb3f9fe17667dd35452"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/commits/d1430f9de2003d231a97532e711f3446afed9fae","verification":{"payload":"tree 03bf54ca0d9edcb39ca5bdb3f9fe17667dd35452\nparent f11931d56c90bd6a671f38dc9920f18da0f1f712\nauthor Þórður H <tolleinn@gmail.com> 1790598927 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790598927 +0000\n\nfix(doe): report timeline edit rows, denial icon, and read-only remedy date picker (#1561)\n\n* fix(doe): name the company on edit rows and cross out denials in the timeline\n\nEdit events never carry an actor: only the applicant edits a report, and\nthey have no doe_user. The row rendered as a headless \"gerði breytingar á\nskýrslu\". Fall back to the company name, as the submitted row already does.\n\nA report moved to DENIED showed the generic event checkmark, which reads as\nthe opposite of a rejection. It now gets a cross.\n\n* fix(doe): disable the remedy deadline picker on the salary tab\n\nisland-ui''s DatePicker controls `open` itself and opens on any input\nclick, so readOnly still popped a calendar for a date nobody can change\nhere. disabled keeps it shut and renders the disabled style, matching\nthe equality plan dates (#1524).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqul8QCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASXwQACI5WVIHK4BEtBG7/b5xJMmZ\n/HE7D/1SyyzGAECEjTvqWyxXr11JoonoB5fWQdAR3NC96btCkrMz7afHBjXGIWJ/\nHnoi0Q04wdV9RX7nez/SIWhrTAQ8Bkm4PWyCl4Nb4FHuXwrZMmxjzgksJyFZh/UC\nlqkHZPZcrv2NP3SCoLUWcSg2bMCQ+ODUwojXh/Y+k1SFOtHJdde9MuOJgB1xrOT2\nTp2IjhT2BaMOp0kDf11u5Bt4lfd90+gfnethO92wjq2ClsLb5HsRBbbHUl+fs7bd\nORtRBdrYK/dmfJCCkiAnokTMCogEiXrgCpWNGv5irpvTmxXmpJ6gUM7VqIb/ioGo\neg5ct9Jrkx0X+7zKcck9PKiFyDURNeYx7XHt4curT7XVSGDCVCuJGjoP4bCq6gxt\nLHXBTyf7qYOsCfn77QeRLKmci9eqKbVpC8PoC0DQVNcvgbThUGc81ZkoKNCMHCql\nprR2Ez79Lln19FdRmfyLUc1WM/NukwfP8p1x5JCiWiwXAcUX2Rx7r1CtYY3r+/HU\n3cSyq+rwfk0UQPDrRdy0xReEnx3baFwjXaL+5QcfuvUG2PPZll4ZCjG7wcYZvuNu\nCVHlHjMTLG+JKDDAZXsRsmSNUCjFLso998eq3xZignduSuBrVlx6qRvq6m6PTlcs\ncAIA3vVBg8rBsHLpxrK7\n=pls8\n-----END PGP SIGNATU