//github.com/jonbjarnio","id":92530555,"login":"jonbjarnio","node_id":"U_kgDOBYPnew","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/f11931d56c90bd6a671f38dc9920f18da0f1f712/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:02:13Z","email":"dev.jonbjarni@gmail.com","name":"Jón Bjarni Ólafsson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:32:47Z","email":"dev.jonbjarni@gmail.com","name":"Jón Bjarni Ólafsson"},"message":"fix(doe): tell \"not in the registry\" apart from a registry failure\n\nFourth review of #1557: checked against the live registry, a valid\nperson''s kennitala it does not hold comes back as 404 with a `skilabod`\nbody, which getEntityByNationalId turns into a 502 — so the admin saw\n\"Villa við uppflettingu\" instead of \"Kennitala fannst ekki\".\n\nThe national-registry client gains findEntityByNationalId, which answers\nthat 404 with { entity: null } and still throws BadGatewayException for\nany other failure. getEntityByNationalId is unchanged, so Legal Gazette\nand the DoE company flows keep their behaviour; only the user lookup\nuses the new method.","tree":{"sha":"042332f5650ae314a5de64bf5450ec0bc7c48be7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/trees/042332f5650ae314a5de64bf5450ec0bc7c48be7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/commits/f11931d56c90bd6a671f38dc9920f18da0f1f712","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars