gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonbjarnio","id":92530555,"login":"jonbjarnio","node_id":"U_kgDOBYPnew","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/3c43fdf3b5bbec8f413df785545d14fb3f2c03ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T10:45:28Z","email":"dev.jonbjarni@gmail.com","name":"Jón Bjarni Ólafsson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:32:47Z","email":"dev.jonbjarni@gmail.com","name":"Jón Bjarni Ólafsson"},"message":"fix(doe): make the user lookup retryable and never stale\n\nReview of #1557:\n\n- Fletta upp on the same kennitala after a failure refetches; it used to\n  set the same state and send nothing.\n- The lookup is never cached (staleTime 0) and creating a user invalidates\n  it, so a just-created kennitala cannot read as not-yet-a-user.\n- The API rejects a kennitala that fails its checksum before asking the\n  registry; its client answers any non-2xx with a 502, so a typo read as\n  \"try again\".\n- Not found, an unusable kennitala and a failed lookup each get their own\n  title.\n- The registry''s full name shows beside the locked name fields.\n- An existing user is answered from the users table without asking the\n  registry, and the response carries the validated input kennitala.\n- Specs pin the order of checks, the table-first path and a registry\n  failure; the mock''s stated reason is corrected.","tree":{"sha":"31eec0326b724e8be002f4e53517f60ab266ea23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/trees/31eec0326b724e8be002f4e53517f60ab266ea23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/commits/3c43fdf3b5bbec8f413df785545d14fb3f2c03ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92530555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonbjarnio","id":92530555,"login":"jonbjarnio","node_id":"U_kgDOBYPnew","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/3c43fdf3b5bbec8f413df785545d14fb3f2c03ac","node_id":"C_kwDOKxEuldoAKDNjNDNmZGYzYjViYmVjOGY0MTNkZjc4NTU0NWQxNGZiM2YyYzAzYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/47b65c62d81467f722d1dbeca9a7aa77957a4e00","sha":"47b65c62d81467f722d1dbeca9a7aa77957a4e00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/47b65c62d81467f722d1dbeca9a7aa77957a4e00"}],"sha":"3c43fdf3b5bbec8f413df785545d14fb3f2c03ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/3c43fdf3b5bbec8f413df785545d14fb3f2c03ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92530555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonbjarnio","id":92530555,"login":"jonbjarnio","node_id":"U_kgDOBYPnew","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/47b65c62d81467f722d1dbeca9a7aa77957a4e00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T10:27:22Z","email":"dev.jonbjarni@gmail.com","name":"Jón Bjarni Ólafsson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:32:47Z","email":"dev.jonbjarni@gmail.com","name":"Jón Bjarni Ólafsson"},"message":"feat(doe): look up new users in the national registry\n\nCreating a user in doe-web now starts from the kennitala alone. Fletta upp\nasks the national registry for the person; the name is filled in\nread-only, and only then do email, phone and role open. A kennitala that is\nalready a user, belongs to a company, or is not in the registry stops the\nform with a warning instead of failing on save.\n\ndoe-api gains GET /users/lookup/:nationalId (ADMIN, like creating a user),\nbacked by UserService.lookupNationalRegistry, which splits the registry''s\none full name at its last space.\n\nAlso fixes the form opening pre-filled with the previous user: it reset\nonly when `user` changed, and creating twice passes null both times while\nthe modal stays mounted. It now resets on every open. The first/last name\npair spans the full modal width.","tree":{"sha":"f5086