,"name":"Jón Bjarni Ólafsson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:24:58Z","email":"dev.jonbjarni@gmail.com","name":"Jón Bjarni Ólafsson"},"message":"fix(doe): pick the consent provider from a radio list, keep the footer pinned\n\nThird review of #1554: allowOverflow let the consent form run past the\nmodal card on a phone, pushing the confirm button off it. A Select''s\ninline menu is clipped by any scrolling body, so providers become radio\nbuttons and the pinned footer comes back.\n\nAlso: the narrow key hint drops its starfsmat example, isNarrowGrant specs\ncover every missing scope and an empty set, and IssueApiKeyInput.scopes\nadmits null, matching resolveApiKeyScopes.","tree":{"sha":"b734d0540092971c8af6318c4917fb7f37c2284b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/trees/b734d0540092971c8af6318c4917fb7f37c2284b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/commits/d8bc28cee57d387e8b219c0132284f540755355b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92530555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonbjarnio","id":92530555,"login":"jonbjarnio","node_id":"U_kgDOBYPnew","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/d8bc28cee57d387e8b219c0132284f540755355b","node_id":"C_kwDOKxEuldoAKGQ4YmMyOGNlZTU3ZDM4N2U4YjIxOWMwMTMyMjg0ZjU0MDc1NTM1NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/448987ac105706b6fc7e55191b3adefaf12690d5","sha":"448987ac105706b6fc7e55191b3adefaf12690d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/448987ac105706b6fc7e55191b3adefaf12690d5"}],"sha":"d8bc28cee57d387e8b219c0132284f540755355b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/d8bc28cee57d387e8b219c0132284f540755355b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92530555?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonbjarnio","id":92530555,"login":"jonbjarnio","node_id":"U_kgDOBYPnew","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonbjarnio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/448987ac105706b6fc7e55191b3adefaf12690d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T14:33:52Z","email":"dev.jonbjarni@gmail.com","name":"Jón Bjarni Ólafsson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:24:58Z","email":"dev.jonbjarni@gmail.com","name":"Jón Bjarni Ólafsson"},"message":"fix(doe): give null scopes the default and word the nar