oth need an upstream island-ui fix: derive the Select''s id\nfrom a slug or `useId` rather than reusing the label.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsTw1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASbYQAICI8NCNybpHyoFxlW4N70xk\nO+pYuPB96XJtwWxUZTZLgnJPBQcymSsKAAAx4mEYiGm+PKoBTpzOFuez1hR4wX6Q\nTs7NP9jjfqJY15PVd3cXvtcogzskIsfELAxl/mLzT/JDZItW/J+OMsopdL0vUmNc\n8V1XIros9Ni6FcVEakJZRW2tPwUsTBIvQWBMB/KJgRy+LKIjcSxYg/K3vw/IgpbB\nl6Pq3J0Lkrv1fC/ravk0N4uc5bvpxTTM9xEQJ6LwVLiiG1UVVJFuh7wNgKMprU9j\nCw8zvQymod2UhHupkmQvmtyAiauzxLSkPfrif4Shekwh3wmHU7W4pg7EXCKXj++9\nlg3l4gw/ZEo0PiijZ23dCNAZt8byO8q/Gxd+I9W8eniQfGvQdRrmVjt3bQCj9s8n\nLDYR820zubn10Y33xKwikV/IvCxsi/qzFAYz/UELEF6842MeBEtOwqO13B4BREyR\ngRpg3MdyAvp8ezVrPqJKI1sFzPrnQ8mf8n0RVOLvPdkqBAymLlyNccGda6T6jHfi\nZCY+V9jPor7bsAGcvBTzYiql1zDldOWrVyMkUUfRcSmzfZhFsSzfCz2v4aGdeXcw\njjLqPruAxmTx9g0ueVLLHAWPzRSqyNQMp8RstpTDwZF8vfHGTYTIBoOijUxupikK\n+fM1/hffabmad1s03zXR\n=r4xF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T14:16:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/722c705d2999a00f0afa6d01ed69eba89040be51","node_id":"C_kwDOKxEuldoAKDcyMmM3MDVkMjk5OWEwMGYwYWZhNmQwMWVkNjllYmE4OTA0MGJlNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DMR-is/dmr.is/commit/a99d51a944d8606cc8f3e347ae5b7ba45a4dbfdc","sha":"a99d51a944d8606cc8f3e347ae5b7ba45a4dbfdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/a99d51a944d8606cc8f3e347ae5b7ba45a4dbfdc"}],"sha":"722c705d2999a00f0afa6d01ed69eba89040be51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/722c705d2999a00f0afa6d01ed69eba89040be51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24840451?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thordurhhh","id":24840451,"login":"thordurhhh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODQwNDUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thordurhhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/commits/a99d51a944d8606cc8f3e347ae5b7ba45a4dbfdc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:01:49Z","email":"tolleinn@gmail.com","name":"Þórður H"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:01:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(doe): drop the correction deadline from the equality report PDF (#1528)\n\n\"Frestur til úrbóta\" belongs to the Directorate''s improvement-plan process,\nnot to an equality plan, so the Yfirlit grid should not offer it. Remove the\nfield from the equality-report template, leaving Auðkenni, Samþykkt and\nGildir til, and pin it with a test that renders a report carrying a stored\ncorrectionDeadline and asserts neither the label nor the date appears.\n\nThe salary report and improvement plan keep their own deadline field, and\ncorrectionDeadline is untouched on the DTO and in the web UI.","tree":{"sha":"f6f10f88ce9671abee733d066ef9fcb6d3d9f8a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/trees/f6f10f88ce9671abee733d066ef9fcb6d3d9f8a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DMR-is/dmr.is/git/commits/a99d51a944d8606cc8f3e347ae5b7ba45a4dbfdc","verification":{"payload":"tree f6f10f88ce9671abee733d066ef9fcb6d3d9f8a6\nparent d336bbaaa852d00988a98bbcb0febb6f83364cdd\nauthor Þórður H <tolleinn@gmail.com> 1789999309 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789999309 +0000\n\nfix(doe): drop the correction deadline from the equality report PDF (#1528)\n\n\"Frestur til úrbóta\" belongs to the Directorate''s improvement-plan process,\nnot to an equality plan, so the Yfirlit grid should not offer it. Remove the\nfield from the equality-report template, leaving Auðkenni, Samþykkt and\nGildir til, and pin it with a test that renders a report carrying a stored\ncorrectionDeadline and asserts neither the label nor the date appears.\n\nThe salary report and improvement plan keep their own deadline field, and\ncorrectionDeadline is untouched on the DTO and in the web UI.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsTjNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAafsQAHN0a/F+1R4m15HUWLs03Hgf\n1aYNL+34iaegyuvig041TAiSUK7fbh1nxXeyxj2ZpROthoqWnIQCw5cJXHBFU00J\n5eceA0bG3JBKZTEf2mqsFbqawdnZ98b2/LapOMp0a28D3rqKwAmaZV0nOJCRvLAF\nMr5WEZ2cErc6coEpZUOXBlNM2drbjHnDFyOsaZKxTQFWU+Q4o4IZlBVXKPw+Ts4T\nyDaRGOHdFptB62oJg6IrgKbWn15c2s6g7rMSqaaPV7H3mc5nPoOYTNg2EOKE4HTs\nXpZz5z3iuWdyrA/HpeebSkMhiOVTFn1u+KCCQnAdV1F+CpC0U/JGVYOJmd1X